<title>USA: Asia Pulp's Indah Kiat unit Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Asia Pulp's Indah Kiat unit Q1 net rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, June 16 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				   (In million U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>					  1997		    1996</p>
<p> Net sales			$    192		 $   157</p>
<p> Oper income			    50			32</p>
<p> Net income			     33			13</p>
<p>Asia Pulp said the 26.3 percent increase in net sales was due to higher average selling prices and increased sales volume following the start of commercial oeprations of the Serang packaging machines 2 and 4 and the pulp driers for Perawang pulp mill 8.</p>
<p>Full company name of parent is Asia Pulp and Paper Co Ltd, which is based in Singapore. PT Indah Kiat Pulp and Paper Corp is a publicly traded unit in Indonesia.</p>
<p>--((New York newdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
